    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Silent Jungle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/54a2eba69daf9557588eaf90d6f2a964.avif?t=1752894813\" data-has-big width=800 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War is a place where human values are buried beneath the rubble of life and death. Is there glory there? Or is it the weak breath and the prolonged silence after the gunfire?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a mission in the dense jungles of Vietnam, Stephen and his squad are ambushed. Gravely wounded, he wakes up alone, disoriented, and lost. A strange, eerie fog blankets the jungle, hiding the scars of brutal battles and whispering the horrors of war. As Stephen searches for a way out, reality twists into a nightmare, images of war\u2019s brutality, tortured souls, and his own haunted past gradually consume him. The deeper he ventures, the tighter the jungle\u2019s grip becomes. Is there a way out, or has he already become part of this silent jungle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the unforgiving jungles of Vietnam</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/e918693ef79a475f76f2785c6dc92c4b.poster.avif?t=1752894813\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/e918693ef79a475f76f2785c6dc92c4b.webm?t=1752894813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/e918693ef79a475f76f2785c6dc92c4b.mp4?t=1752894813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immerse yourself in a classic-inspired nightmare, with a top-down view and an unrelenting eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you have the courage to fight... or will you run?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/0b1527029c215ca17b9e403a564362d0.poster.avif?t=1752894813\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/0b1527029c215ca17b9e403a564362d0.webm?t=1752894813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/0b1527029c215ca17b9e403a564362d0.mp4?t=1752894813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With limited supplies and enemies lurking in the shadows, every shot counts. Ammo is scarce\u2014it could be your salvation or your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Uncover the horrors of war</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/21eb09770d25aec05e5b020ab34804ba.poster.avif?t=1752894813\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/21eb09770d25aec05e5b020ab34804ba.webm?t=1752894813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/21eb09770d25aec05e5b020ab34804ba.mp4?t=1752894813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the blood-soaked battleground, fear is your only certainty. The jungle echoes with the cries of the fallen, and every shadow hides a story of pain, madness, and something far worse. Survival is not just about fighting the enemy\u2014it's about facing the terror war leaves behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D top-down horror game inspired by classic survival horror, with old-school design and a relentlessly eerie atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No guidance\u2014you're on your own. Pay attention to dialogues, letters, notes\u2014even items\u2014and piece everything together yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight terrifying creatures lurking in the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid traps and environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade spirit coins for healing, and survival advantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters. Moving while shooting will throw off your aim, and relentless action will drain your strength. Fight wisely\u2014or fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the war\u2019s underground tunnels\u2014every corner hides deadly traps and unseen dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you face demons... or the darkness within yourself?\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE JUNGLE...</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Silent Jungle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/54a2eba69daf9557588eaf90d6f2a964.avif?t=1752894813\" data-has-big width=800 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War is a place where human values are buried beneath the rubble of life and death. Is there glory there? Or is it the weak breath and the prolonged silence after the gunfire?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a mission in the dense jungles of Vietnam, Stephen and his squad are ambushed. Gravely wounded, he wakes up alone, disoriented, and lost. A strange, eerie fog blankets the jungle, hiding the scars of brutal battles and whispering the horrors of war. As Stephen searches for a way out, reality twists into a nightmare, images of war\u2019s brutality, tortured souls, and his own haunted past gradually consume him. The deeper he ventures, the tighter the jungle\u2019s grip becomes. Is there a way out, or has he already become part of this silent jungle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the unforgiving jungles of Vietnam</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/e918693ef79a475f76f2785c6dc92c4b.poster.avif?t=1752894813\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/e918693ef79a475f76f2785c6dc92c4b.webm?t=1752894813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/e918693ef79a475f76f2785c6dc92c4b.mp4?t=1752894813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immerse yourself in a classic-inspired nightmare, with a top-down view and an unrelenting eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you have the courage to fight... or will you run?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/0b1527029c215ca17b9e403a564362d0.poster.avif?t=1752894813\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/0b1527029c215ca17b9e403a564362d0.webm?t=1752894813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/0b1527029c215ca17b9e403a564362d0.mp4?t=1752894813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With limited supplies and enemies lurking in the shadows, every shot counts. Ammo is scarce\u2014it could be your salvation or your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Uncover the horrors of war</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/21eb09770d25aec05e5b020ab34804ba.poster.avif?t=1752894813\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/21eb09770d25aec05e5b020ab34804ba.webm?t=1752894813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593760/extras/21eb09770d25aec05e5b020ab34804ba.mp4?t=1752894813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the blood-soaked battleground, fear is your only certainty. The jungle echoes with the cries of the fallen, and every shadow hides a story of pain, madness, and something far worse. Survival is not just about fighting the enemy\u2014it's about facing the terror war leaves behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D top-down horror game inspired by classic survival horror, with old-school design and a relentlessly eerie atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No guidance\u2014you're on your own. Pay attention to dialogues, letters, notes\u2014even items\u2014and piece everything together yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight terrifying creatures lurking in the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid traps and environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade spirit coins for healing, and survival advantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters. Moving while shooting will throw off your aim, and relentless action will drain your strength. Fight wisely\u2014or fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the war\u2019s underground tunnels\u2014every corner hides deadly traps and unseen dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you face demons... or the darkness within yourself?\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE JUNGLE...</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "The Silent Jungle is a classic survival horror game set deep within the haunting jungles of Vietnam. After a brutal ambush, a lost American soldier must survive in a cursed jungle filled with lethal traps and haunting illusions. To escape, he must uncover its dark secrets and break the curse.",
